  "summary": "RPO UA6 anti-theft alarm: the alarm relay and flasher mounted on a bracket behind the seat near the jack stowage compartment, and the alarm body wiring routed under the carpet from the instrument-panel-to-body harness connector back to the rear. The bracket is riveted to the body through four holes; the relay is screwed to the bracket (19-27 LBS IN) and the flasher sits in a clip screwed to the bracket (13-18 LBS IN). The harness grommet is sealed with seam cement and a harness lead is held by the UPC 12 screw and clip with a lock washer.",
